     1259       DISABLE RECT-2 RECT-3 RECT-1 R-curr T-terms F-val b-valp T-price-brutto T-price-netto button-prod T-qnty-all E-post T-VAT T-slt T-part-code F-val-name WITH FRAME F-Main.
     1260       RUN dispatch ('disable-fields':U).
     1261       RUN set-attribute-list ('ENABLED=no':U).
