     1317   PROCEDURE get-attribute-list :
     1318     DEFINE OUTPUT PARAMETER p-attr-list AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     1319     RUN broker-get-attribute-list IN adm-broker-hdl
     1320         (INPUT THIS-PROCEDURE,
     1321          INPUT ?,
     1322          OUTPUT p-attr-list) NO-ERROR.
     1323     RETURN.
